6. SonarScanner Not Found
-------------------------

Pipeline

tool 'SonarScanner'

must exactly match

Manage Jenkins
→ Global Tool Configuration
→ SonarScanner

Names are Case Sensitive.

------------------------------------------------------------

7. Wrong Jenkins Pipeline Agent
-------------------------------

Wrong

agent jenkinsagent

Correct

agent {
    label 'jenkinsagent'
}

------------------------------------------------------------

8. Sonar Maven Plugin Missing
-----------------------------

Error

No plugin found for prefix 'sonar'

Reason

pom.xml missing sonar plugin.

Add

<plugin>
    <groupId>org.sonarsource.scanner.maven</groupId>
    <artifactId>sonar-maven-plugin</artifactId>
    <version>5.1.0.4751</version>
</plugin>

