11. Quality Gate Waiting
------------------------

Pipeline

timeout(time:5, unit:'MINUTES') {
    waitForQualityGate abortPipeline:true
}

This DOES NOT wait 5 minutes.

It waits only until Sonar finishes.

5 minutes is Maximum Timeout.

