Check

df -h

Clean

docker system prune -af

docker image prune -af

docker builder prune -af

docker volume prune -f

rm -rf ~/.cache/trivy

rm -rf /tmp/trivy*

Best Solution

Increase Jenkins Agent Root Volume

8 GB

↓

20 GB

