22. Golden Troubleshooting Flow
-------------------------------

1. Read First ERROR (Ignore skipped stages)

2. Check Jenkins Agent Online

3. Check Disk

df -h

4. Verify Required Tools

java --version

mvn --version

docker --version

trivy --version

kubectl version --client

aws --version

5. Verify Docker Permission

groups

docker ps

6. Verify SonarQube

Server Reachable

Token Configured

Webhook Configured

7. Verify AWS

aws sts get-caller-identity

aws ecr describe-repositories

8. Verify Kubernetes

kubectl get nodes

kubectl get pods -A

9. Re-run Pipeline

------------------------------------------------------------

